stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  [*] --> idle: app 启动
  idle --> scanning: refresh
  scanning --> writing: parse_done(全部文件处理完)
  writing --> idle: write_done
  scanning --> quit: app_quit
  writing --> quit: app_quit
  idle --> quit: app_quit
  quit --> [*]
  note right of scanning
    scanning 中再来 refresh 一律忽略(去重)
    坏行跳过计数,不弃整个文件
  end note
  note right of writing
    原子写:临时文件 + rename
    quit 打断也不产生半截缓存
  end note
